WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:19.686
Stop, Fine.

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.980
-I can't go on.
-Nonsense.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.815
We're just getting started.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.235
So I guess that's
Lady Fine's current favorite.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:30.530
She's fickle.
I'm sure she'll grow bored soon.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:33.950
Look at her, ignoring her queenly duties
and dancing the days away.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.285
Deplorable.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.001
Fine.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.295
Oh, no. Oh, my.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:54.095
Wait here. I'm stepping out for fresh air.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.556
Picture-perfect.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:57.724
Lady Fine.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:00:59.976
Now, now. Wait your turn.

